@subsection tool_python_merlin_audit_a100_study_py python/merlin/audit_a100_study.py
@ref audit_a100_study.py "Source/API reference".

**Purpose.** Verify complete A100/CPU study scope and saved hashes, not physical acceptance.

**Usage.**
@code{.sh}
python -B demos/cosmology/python/merlin/audit_a100_study.py GPU_REPORT --cpu-report CPU_REPORT --launch-evidence LAUNCH_EVIDENCE --output OUTPUT
@endcode
Machine evidence and allocated-device identity must match the strict launcher/audit configuration. It does not grant permission to operate on an unrelated process or imply GPU accuracy.

