@subsection tool_python_validate_zarija_py python/validate_zarija.py
@ref validate_zarija.py "Source/API reference".

**Purpose.** Compare actual Zarija and IPPL Gaussian 1LPT initial conditions.

**Usage.**
@code{.sh}
python -B demos/cosmology/python/validate_zarija.py --ippl-exe IPPL_EXE --zarija-exe ZARIJA_EXE --zarija-source ZARIJA_SOURCE
@endcode

@section tools_shell Build and deployment scripts

@subsection tool_reference_build_fastpm_sh reference/build_fastpm.sh
**Purpose.** Build pinned native FastPM and host dependencies with checksum/source provenance.

**Usage.**
@code{.sh}
bash demos/cosmology/reference/build_fastpm.sh BUILD_DIRECTORY
@endcode
FASTPM_CC, FASTPM_MPICC, FASTPM_FFTW_PREFIX, FASTPM_JOBS select local compiler/dependency settings. This is opt-in acquisition, not a normal CTest dependency.

**Source.**
@verbinclude build_fastpm.sh

@subsection tool_reference_build_fastpm_evolution_sh reference/build_fastpm_evolution.sh
**Purpose.** Link the native evolution harness to the frozen-force libraries, verifying them before/after.

**Usage.**
@code{.sh}
bash demos/cosmology/reference/build_fastpm_evolution.sh FASTPM_BUILD_DIRECTORY [OUTPUT_DIRECTORY]
@endcode
Does not rebuild/modify the frozen-force libraries or replace native evolution. Retains a separate manifest.

**Source.**
@verbinclude build_fastpm_evolution.sh

@subsection tool_reference_build_gadget2_sh reference/build_gadget2.sh
**Purpose.** Build missing periodic double-precision GADGET-2/FFTW2 for a chosen PMGRID.

**Usage.**
@code{.sh}
bash demos/cosmology/reference/build_gadget2.sh BUILD_DIRECTORY PMGRID GSL_PREFIX
@endcode
GADGET_CC, GADGET_MPICC and BUILD_JOBS select toolchain/jobs. Source archives are checksum-pinned; existing executable is reused. Generic ARM configuration handles FFTW2 on Apple Silicon.

**Source.**
@verbinclude build_gadget2.sh

@subsection tool_reference_build_zarija_sh reference/build_zarija.sh
**Purpose.** Compile the supplied original initializer separately and retain source/ABI provenance.

**Usage.**
@code{.sh}
bash demos/cosmology/reference/build_zarija.sh REFERENCE_SOURCE BUILD_DIRECTORY
@endcode
See the script header for compiler/FFTW options. Original source is not edited; binary sizes/endian conventions are recorded.

**Source.**
@verbinclude build_zarija.sh

@subsection tool_merlin_cpu_validation_sh merlin/cpu_validation.sh
**Purpose.** Prepare/build/run the declared Merlin CPU study with phase/status evidence.

**Usage.**
@code{.sh}
bash -l demos/cosmology/merlin/cpu_validation.sh [--login] ABSOLUTE_NEW_EVIDENCE_DIRECTORY
@endcode
Use its printed usage for supported actions and explicit campaign roots. Requires the documented modules/storage/host; does not claim a pass from exit alone.

**Source.**
@verbinclude cpu_validation.sh

@subsection tool_merlin_a100_validation_sh merlin/a100_validation.sh
**Purpose.** Build/run/audit the declared allocated-A100 study using strict GPU/MPI evidence.

**Usage.**
@code{.sh}
bash -l demos/cosmology/merlin/a100_validation.sh build|run ABS_CPU_EVIDENCE ABS_GPU_EVIDENCE
@endcode
Requires the recorded CPU baseline, scheduler allocation, module/toolchain and strict launcher configuration. No new GPU qualification is inferred from preparing a build.

**Source.**
@verbinclude a100_validation.sh

@subsection tool_gadget2_build_gadget2_np256_sh gadget2/build_gadget2_np256.sh
**Purpose.** Rebuild only the frozen Merlin PMGRID=256 executable and require its approved binary hash.

**Usage.**
@code{.sh}
bash demos/cosmology/gadget2/build_gadget2_np256.sh
@endcode
Fixed campaign paths/archive/Makefile/patch/binary hashes; not the portable local builder. Refuses rebuild after the campaign starts.

**Source.**
@verbinclude build_gadget2_np256.sh

@subsection tool_gadget2_run_gadget2_np256_login_sh gadget2/run_gadget2_np256.login.sh
**Purpose.** Run the frozen 256³ controller/analysis/plots in its declared login workflow.

**Usage.**
@code{.sh}
bash demos/cosmology/gadget2/run_gadget2_np256.login.sh
@endcode
This script targets the retained Merlin campaign, not local 128³ paths.

**Source.**
@verbinclude run_gadget2_np256.login.sh

@subsection tool_gadget2_run_gadget2_np256_sbatch gadget2/run_gadget2_np256.sbatch
**Purpose.** Submit the frozen 256³ GADGET comparison inside a scheduler allocation.

**Usage.**
@code{.sh}
sbatch demos/cosmology/gadget2/run_gadget2_np256.sbatch
@endcode
Submission is a separate user action; generating this documentation never submits a job.

**Source.**
@verbinclude run_gadget2_np256.sbatch

@subsection tools_configuration Build and input configuration
`CMakeLists.txt` registers the applications, optional Python/native-reference validation and documentation targets. `input/linear-sine.par`, `input/linear-gaussian.par` and `input/linear-uniform.par` are the shipped generated-IC examples. `gadget2/pmgrid256.patch` is the frozen historical PMGRID configuration change, not an IPPL gravity implementation.

@section tools_doc_tools Documentation tools
`python/build_documentation.py` builds the strict Doxygen site and checks extracted API coverage. `python/doxygen_filter.py` is used only by the documentation parser to recognize bare annotated Python fields; it never executes transformed text. `python/tests/test_documentation.py` checks the documentation infrastructure independently of simulation results.

*/
